@startuml Pengurus_Form_Smart_v2

title Sequence Diagram - Form Pengurus dengan Periode & Smart Filter (Iterasi 2)

actor Admin
participant System
database Database

Admin -> System: Klik tombol "Tambah Pengurus"
System -> Database: Query dislat_periods
Database --> System: Return list periode
System --> Admin: Tampilkan modal form dengan dropdown periode

Admin -> System: Pilih periode dari dropdown
System -> Database: Fetch periode details (tanggal_buka, tanggal_tutup)
Database --> System: Return periode data
System -> System: Auto-fill tanggal_buka & tanggal_tutup (readonly)
System --> Admin: Display auto-filled dates

Admin -> System: Klik field "Anggota"
System -> Database: Query member WHERE status=active AND not_board_member
Database --> System: Return filtered member list
System --> Admin: Tampilkan dropdown member (smart filtered)

Admin -> System: Pilih anggota dari dropdown
System -> System: Validate member not already board member
System -> System: Check member status = active
System --> Admin: Display konfirmasi nama + NIM

Admin -> System: Pilih jabatan dan upload foto
Admin -> System: Klik tombol "Simpan"
System -> Database: Validate all fields + periode + member
System -> Database: Create/Update board_member record
Database --> System: Success
System --> Admin: Display success message

@enduml
